<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Sept wholesale prices.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Sept wholesale prices.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
